&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6313&quot; data-local-id=&quot;37af2be3-becc-46fb-994a-1d40d9598fcd&quot;&gt;Identify areas of improvement and advocate for best practices&lt;/p&gt;
