&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6378&quot; data-local-id=&quot;76a9e50e-4f23-4970-91da-582cbd042139&quot;&gt;Have an active voice in shaping both technology and product decisions&lt;/p&gt;
