&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6560&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4b0bcb7a-5a05-4bec-a79b-8704d08beae3&quot;&gt;Polyglot background with an ability to context switch between languages quickly&lt;/p&gt;
