&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a driven, customer-focused sales professional to join our Corporate Account Executive team at LaunchDarkly. In this role, you’ll manage the full sales cycle, partnering with sales leadership, solutions engineers, and cross-functional teams to guide corporate customers across EMEA through evaluation, purchase, and successful adoption of LaunchDarkly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you thrive in a fast-paced, consultative sales environment, have experience selling to small and mid-sized companies, and are eager to make an impact, we’d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
