&lt;h4&gt;About the Job:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LaunchDarkly is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Corporate&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Regional Sales Director EMEA to lead the strategy and execution of our Corporate EMEA sales business. This leader will own regional performance across new business and expansion, lead and develop frontline sales leadership and Account Executives, and build the operating discipline needed for predictable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role combines hands-on commercial leadership with organizational leadership. The Regional Sales Director will set the regional plan, inspect pipeline and forecast, coach leaders through complex deals, shape territory and capacity decisions, and partner closely with Marketing, SDR, Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, Revenue Operations, and Enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is designed for a sales leader who can operate across Corporate EMEA segments, translate global strategy into regional execution, and build a high-performing, accountable, and inclusive team in a fast-growing SaaS environment.&lt;/p&gt;
