&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Corporate EMEA performance and strategy.&lt;/strong&gt; Set the regional plan for new logo acquisition, expansion, pipeline creation, coverage, and revenue attainment across the Corporate EMEA business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead through frontline managers.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and support sales managers and Account Executives through clear goals, consistent operating rhythms, coaching, and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive predictable forecasting.&lt;/strong&gt; Own forecast accuracy, pipeline inspection, stage discipline, deal progression, and risk management across the region; provide clear updates and actions to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build pipeline and improve conversion.&lt;/strong&gt; Establish expectations for prospecting, partner with SDR and Marketing leaders on pipeline generation, and remove barriers to conversion across the funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach complex sales execution.&lt;/strong&gt; Support strategic opportunities, executive alignment, multi-threading, value articulation, negotiation, and close plans across technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape territory, coverage, and capacity.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Revenue Operations and senior sales leadership on territory design, segmentation, headcount planning, quota allocation, hiring priorities, and organizational structure.&lt;/li&gt;
