&lt;p&gt;LaunchDarkly is redefining how modern software is built and operated. As AI transforms software development, we believe the future belongs to organizations that can move at AI speed while maintaining control in production. We&#39;re looking for a strategic external communications leader to help make that vision impossible to ignore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of Corporate Marketing, you&#39;ll lead the team responsible for translating our company strategy into a cohesive market narrative that influences customers, analysts, media, developers, and industry leaders. You&#39;ll own our external communications strategy across public relations, analyst relations, social media, and executive communications while partnering closely with Product Marketing, Content Marketing, Demand Generation, and our executive team to ensure every external touchpoint reinforces the same story.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who thinks beyond communications channels and is energized by shaping markets, influencing industry conversations, and building category leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
