&lt;li&gt;Identify emerging market conversations and flag opportunities for LaunchDarkly engagement..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a team of three spanning Public Relations, Analyst Relations, and Social Media, creating a high-performing organization focused on influence, quality, and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage thought-leadership programs for the CEO, CTO, SVP of Product and other key executives to position LaunchDarkly leaders as trusted authorities on software delivery, AI, and modern engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
