&lt;li&gt;Support analyst relations efforts with Gartner, Forrester, IDC, RedMonk, and other key firms by ensuring consistent, accurate messaging on LaunchDarkly&#39;s products and differentiation..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track communications metrics across share of voice, analyst perception, executive visibility, and market influence and surface insights to inform strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
