&lt;li&gt;Typically brings 15+ years of experience in corporate communications, product communications, corporate marketing, or related leadership roles within high-growth B2B software companies and 5 years of leadership experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success building integrated communications strategies that strengthen market positioning, thought leadership, and executive visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing high-performing communications organizations across multiple disciplines, including public relations, analyst relations, executive communications, and/or social media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong point of view on how modern B2B technology companies build market influence beyond traditional public relations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional storytelling, messaging, and executive communication skills, with the ability to translate complex technical concepts into compelling market narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Preferred) Background in developer tools, DevOps, cloud infrastructure, AI platforms, or enterprise software serving technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Preferred) Experience supporting category creation, major market repositioning efforts, or new product category launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Preferred) Experience partnering closely with Product Marketing and executive leadership to shape corporate positioning and thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
