&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7204&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1d99782c9741&quot;&gt;Build the experimentation statistical engine — hypothesis testing, sequential analysis, variance reduction (&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;CUPED&lt;/span&gt;, Winsorization), power analysis. Ensure statistical correctness across all experiment types.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c487b615106e&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7416&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a37de6d4875e&quot;&gt;Design warehouse-native experimentation that runs analysis inside customer warehouses (Snowflake, Databricks, Redshift, BigQuery). Build modular, warehouse-agnostic abstractions for rapid new backend support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
