&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7630&quot; data-local-id=&quot;88e21a3c73d8&quot;&gt;Lead adaptive experimentation — contextual bandit systems, Bayesian optimization, automated allocation beyond simple A/B tests.&lt;/p&gt;
