&lt;p&gt;As a Strategic Account Executive, you will own the relationship with the most strategic customers in your territory. You will play a significant role in the expansion of growth within these accounts. You should be business oriented, customer focused, and a self-starter who works well with little supervision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h4&gt;
