&lt;li&gt;Territory and Account Planning: Develop comprehensive territory and account plans,&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;proactively drive&lt;/em&gt; outbound pipeline generation independently, and collaborate effectively with Business Development Representatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Successful Adoption: Ensure the seamless adoption of LaunchDarkly within these large enterprises through robust account management. Coordinate closely with pre-and-post sales engineering, customer success, and support teams to guarantee client satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
